  CNN[1D-CNN:<br/>kernel / stride / channels]
  RNN[RNN: hidden /<br/>sequence / LSTM-GRU]
  FUSED[Fused 3-branch net:<br/>one forward /<br/>trained on noise]
  GPU[Hardware matters:<br/>GPU payoff]

  TRANS[Transformer to<br/>ellmer bridge]
  ELLMER[LLM as typed<br/>reproducible ETL]
  SCHEMA[type_object<br/>typed schema]
  LLMPAR[LLM params:<br/>model / temperature /<br/>typing]
